acceptance_criteria: "compareLogValues (or its successor) is a strict weak ordering over any mix of created_at stamps for items at the new canonicalization version; History streams written before the change keep verifying and replaying unchanged, proven by a committed mixed-stamp history fixture; pm validate reports annotation entries whose created_at does not parse, with the item id, collection and index"
